    category: "Linux",
    title: "Amazon Linux 2027 公開預覽版發布：搭載 Linux 7.1 核心、LTO 優化與 x86-64-v3 架構支援",
    summary: "AWS 今日宣布 Amazon Linux 2027 的公開預覽版。相較於 Amazon Linux 2023，2027 版本進行了大量的軟體更新、效能優化，旨在為 AWS 雲端工作負載提供更佳的運行體驗。技術層面，Amazon Linux 2027 預設使用 Linux 7.1 核心，並預設啟用 SELinux 的強制執行模式，同時新增了各種加速器驅動。在編譯與效能方面，所有套件均以 -O2 優化等級編譯，並啟用連結時優化（LTO）以提升效能。x86-64 套件現已針對 x86-64-v3 進行目標設定，支援 AVX/AVX2，並啟用自動向量化。對於 AArch64 Graviton 實例，系統預設啟用 Transparent Hugepages (THP) 來提升 ARM 效能。此外，Amazon Linux 2027 預設採用 GCC 16.1、LLVM/Clang 22，並更新了 Rust 與 Go 版本，套件管理器則升級至 DNF5。該版本部分基於 Fedora 44 和 Fedora 45，為開發者提供了更現代、更高效能的 Linux 運行環境。",
    tags: ["Amazon Linux", "Linux 7.1", "AWS", "SELinux", "LTO", "GCC 16.1", "DNF5"],
    title_en: "Amazon Linux 2027 Public Preview Released: Featuring Linux 7.1 Kernel, LTO Optimization, and x86-64-v3 Support",
    summary_en: "AWS today announced the public preview of Amazon Linux 2027. Compared to Amazon Linux 2023, the 2027 version includes extensive software updates and performance optimizations, aiming to provide an enhanced operational experience for AWS cloud workloads. Technically, Amazon Linux 2027 defaults to the Linux 7.1 kernel and enables SELinux in enforcing mode, while also adding various accelerator drivers. In terms of compilation and performance, all packages are compiled with -O2 optimization level and enable Link Time Optimization (LTO) to boost efficiency. The x86-64 packages are now targeted for x86-64-v3, supporting AVX/AVX2, and enabling automatic vectorization. For AArch64 Graviton instances, the system defaults to Transparent Hugepages (THP) to improve ARM performance. Furthermore, Amazon Linux 2027 defaults to GCC 16.1 and LLVM/Clang 22, and updates the versions of Rust and Go, with the package manager upgraded to DNF5. This version is partially based on Fedora 44 and Fedora 45, offering developers a more modern and high-performance Linux runtime environment.",
    tags_en: ["Amazon Linux", "Linux 7.1", "AWS", "SELinux", "LTO", "GCC 16.1", "DNF5"],
    sources: [
      { name: "Phoronix", url: "https://phoronix.com/news/Amazon-Linux-2027-Preview", lang: "EN" }
    ]
