    category: "Linux",
    title: "InputPlumber 0.79 重大更新：擴展支援多款遊戲掌機與周邊設備",
    summary: "InputPlumber 是一個開源的 Linux 路由和重新映射守護程序，廣受 Linux 遊戲掌機玩家青睞。它能整合多種輸入設備，並將操作轉換為虛擬設備格式，支援模擬滑鼠、鍵盤和遊戲手柄輸入。最新發布的 InputPlumber 0.79 版本，大幅擴展了硬體支援範圍並修復了多個錯誤。本次更新新增了對多款 AYN 遊戲掌機的支援，包括 AYN Odin 2、Odin 2 Mini、Odin 2 Portal、Odin 3 和 THor 等。此外，也增加了對多款 Retroid Pocket 遊戲掌機的支援，如 Pocket 5、Pocket 6、Pocket Flip 2、Pocket Mini、Pocket Mini V2 和 Pocket Nova。同時，也加入了 KONKR Pocket FIT 控制器的支援。其他改動包括正確映射 ASUS ROG Xbox Ally X 的按鍵，以及使用 WMI 事件為 MSI Claw 系列的導引按鈕提供支援。使用者可透過 GitHub 下載最新版本。",
    tags: ["InputPlumber", "Linux", "遊戲掌機", "AOSP", "遊戲周邊", "Open Source"],
    title_en: "InputPlumber 0.79 Major Update: Expanded Support for Multiple Gaming Handhelds and Peripherals",
    summary_en: "InputPlumber is an open-source Linux routing and remapping daemon, highly favored by Linux handheld gaming enthusiasts. It integrates various input devices and converts their operations into virtual device formats, supporting simulated mouse, keyboard, and gamepad inputs. The newly released InputPlumber 0.79 version significantly expands hardware support and fixes numerous bugs. This update adds support for multiple AYN gaming handhelds, including the AYN Odin 2, Odin 2 Mini, Odin 2 Portal, Odin 3, and THor. Furthermore, it adds support for various Retroid Pocket handhelds, such as the Pocket 5, Pocket 6, Pocket Flip 2, Pocket Mini, Pocket Mini V2, and Pocket Nova. It also includes support for the KONKR Pocket FIT controller. Other changes include accurate key mapping for the ASUS ROG Xbox Ally X and providing support for the guide buttons on the MSI Claw series using WMI events. Users can download the latest version from GitHub.",
    tags_en: ["InputPlumber", "Linux", "Handheld Gaming", "AOSP", "Gaming Peripherals", "Open Source"],
    sources: [
      { name: "Phoronix", url: "https://phoronix.com/news/InputPlumber-0.79", lang: "EN" }
    ]
