    summary: "Apache Allura 軟體因其 Markdown HTML 處理機制存在一個嚴重的儲存型跨站腳本攻擊（Stored XSS）漏洞，編號為 CVE-2026-80180。此漏洞影響範圍涵蓋所有從 Apache Allura 版本到 1.20.0 的版本。攻擊者可透過惡意的 Markdown 內容，在應用程式中儲存並執行惡意腳本，進而危害使用者或系統的安全性。為修復此漏洞，建議所有使用者立即將 Apache Allura 升級至 1.21.0 或更高版本。本漏洞的修復建議已由開發者提供，使用者應儘速更新以避免風險。",
    tags: ["Apache Allura", "CVE-2026-80180", "Stored XSS", "Markdown", "跨站腳本攻擊"],
    title_en: "Apache Allura has Stored XSS Vulnerability: CVE-2026-80180, Exploitable via Markdown HTML Processing",
    summary_en: "The Apache Allura software contains a critical Stored Cross-Site Scripting (XSS) vulnerability, identified as CVE-2026-80180, due to its Markdown HTML processing mechanism. This vulnerability affects all versions of Apache Allura from [initial version] up to 1.20.0. An attacker can store and execute malicious scripts within the application using malicious Markdown content, thereby compromising user or system security. To remediate this vulnerability, all users are advised to immediately upgrade Apache Allura to version 1.21.0 or higher. The developer has provided a patch, and users should update promptly to mitigate risk.",
    tags_en: ["Apache Allura", "CVE-2026-80180", "Stored XSS", "Markdown", "Cross-Site Scripting"],
    sources: [
      { name: "Openwall oss-security", url: "https://openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2026/09/03/3", lang: "EN" }
    ]
