    title: "Nakivo 發布 11.2.2 版本，擴大備份保護支援至 VMware vSphere 9.1 及多種作業系統",
    summary: "資料保護軟體廠商 Nakivo 近期發布了 Backup & Replication 11.2.2 版本。此版本的主要更新內容是擴展了其備份保護的支援範圍。在虛擬化平臺方面，新增了對 VMware vSphere 9.1 的支援。此外，它也擴展了對多種實體主機作業系統的支援，包括 Debian 13、Ubuntu 25.10 與 26.04 LTS、SLES 16、RHEL 10，以及 Windows 10 IoT 版和 Windows 11 26H1。在基礎設施部署環境方面，11.2.2 版本也增加了對更多儲存平臺的支援，例如 HPE StoreOnce VSA 版的 Gen4 與 Gen5，以及 QNAP 的 QuTS hero 和 QTS 等消費級儲存設備。這些更新旨在提升備份解決方案的兼容性與保護能力，讓用戶能更全面地保護多樣化的 IT 環境。",
    tags: ["Nakivo", "Backup & Replication", "VMware vSphere 9.1", "備份解決方案", "HPE StoreOnce", "QNAP"],
    title_en: "Nakivo Releases 11.2.2 Version, Expanding Backup Protection Support to VMware vSphere 9.1 and Multiple Operating Systems",
    summary_en: "Data protection software vendor Nakivo recently released Backup & Replication 11.2.2. The main update in this version is the expansion of its backup protection support scope. Regarding virtualization platforms, support for VMware vSphere 9.1 has been added. Furthermore, it has expanded support for various physical host operating systems, including Debian 13, Ubuntu 25.10 and 26.04 LTS, SLES 16, RHEL 10, and Windows 10 IoT and Windows 11 26H1. In terms of infrastructure deployment environments, the 11.2.2 version also adds support for more storage platforms, such as Gen4 and Gen5 of HPE StoreOnce VSA, and consumer-grade storage devices like QNAP's QuTS hero and QTS. These updates aim to enhance the compatibility and protection capabilities of the backup solution, allowing users to protect diverse IT environments more comprehensively.",
    tags_en: ["Nakivo", "Backup & Replication", "VMware vSphere 9.1", "Backup Solution", "HPE StoreOnce", "QNAP"],
    sources: [
      { name: "iThome", url: "https://ithome.com.tw/news/178656", lang: "ZH-TW" }
    ]
