    title: "Google 推出 Gmail Live、Docs Live 與 Keep Live，透過語音介面實現自然語言互動",
    summary: "Google 近期宣布並推出三項新的語音功能：Gmail Live、Docs Live 和 Keep Live。這些功能整合了 Gemini AI，旨在讓使用者能透過自然語音對話，取代傳統的手動操作。Gmail Live 允許使用者直接與信箱進行「自然對話」，從中提取精確資訊，並能處理多輪追問，介面會顯示完整的文字稿和來源郵件連結。Docs Live 定位為「免手動思考夥伴」，可根據 Gmail、Drive、Chat 及網頁資訊，協助使用者快速生成摘要、提案等草稿，並可根據指令進行格式調整。Keep Live 則專門用於聆聽「語音思緒傾瀉」，將口述內容自動轉化為筆記和清單，甚至可以新增或編輯現有筆記。這些功能目前在 Android 和 iOS 上，需搭配 Google AI Plus、Pro 或 Ultra 訂閱服務。Google 預計將逐步開放給 Google Workspace 的企業客戶。",
    tags: ["Google", "Gemini", "Gmail Live", "Docs Live", "Keep Live", "AI", "Google Workspace"],
    title_en: "Google Launches Gmail Live, Docs Live, and Keep Live to Enable Natural Language Interaction via Voice Interface",
    summary_en: "Google recently announced and launched three new voice functionalities: Gmail Live, Docs Live, and Keep Live. These features integrate Gemini AI, aiming to allow users to interact with their data through natural voice conversation, replacing traditional manual operations. Gmail Live allows users to engage in 'natural dialogue' with their inbox, extracting precise information and handling multi-turn follow-up questions. The interface displays a full transcript and links to the source emails. Docs Live is positioned as a 'thought-free partner,' assisting users in quickly generating drafts—such as summaries and proposals—based on information from Gmail, Drive, Chat, and web pages, and allowing for format adjustments via commands. Keep Live is specifically designed for capturing 'spoken thoughts,' automatically converting spoken content into notes and lists, and even allowing users to add or edit existing notes. These features are currently available on Android and iOS, requiring a Google AI Plus, Pro, or Ultra subscription. Google plans to gradually roll out these features to Google Workspace enterprise customers.",
    tags_en: ["Google", "Gemini", "Gmail Live", "Docs Live", "Keep Live", "AI", "Google Workspace"],
    sources: [
      { name: "9to5Google", url: "https://9to5google.com/2026/09/03/gmail-docs-keep-live", lang: "EN" }
    ]
