    summary_en: "At the IFA 2026 exhibition, Anker announced a major brand consolidation effort. Several of its core brands—including Anker, Eufy, Soundcore, EufyMake, and Solix—will gradually be unified under the single 'Anker' brand. This consolidation will divide the product lines into two main groups: 'Anker for You' and 'Anker for Home.' 'Anker for You' will handle charging devices, audio products, and personal health monitoring, while 'Anker for Home' will focus on security devices, robotics, and smart home energy management. This transformation will be rolled out gradually through new product releases, and existing product lines will also be integrated into the new brand naming system. The exhibition also featured several new products, including the Soundcore AeroClip 2 Pro earbuds and Sleep 4/Sleep 4 Pro sleep monitoring devices for 'Anker for You,' and the Anker Eufy TrackLight Cam S1 camera and Omni E35 robotic vacuum cleaner for 'Anker for Home,' demonstrating Anker's strengthened focus on smart living and home security.",
