    title: "OpenAI發布GPT-6 Astra：大幅升級ChatGPT與Codex，具備頂尖的網路安全與工程能力",
    summary: "OpenAI正式宣布推出全新模型GPT-6 Astra，宣稱這是「世界上最智慧且最符合人心的模型」。此模型整合了多年的研究成果，在電腦操作、瀏覽、軟體工程、科學和專業工作等領域均達到最先進水平。GPT-6 Astra在多項專業測試中表現卓越，例如在FrontierMath Tier 4上取得98%的評分，並在ExploitBench上達到100%的評分，顯示其強大的能力。在軟體工程方面，OpenAI稱其為「迄今為止最好的模型」，並特別升級了Codex，使其能夠在上下文視窗滿載時，保留並檢索跨越多次對話的累積細節，而非僅依賴摘要。OpenAI將GPT-6 Astra的能力描述為「重大提升的網路安全能力」，並聲稱其符合「準備度框架」中的關鍵門檻。目前該模型正逐步向有限的組織推出，之後將開放給所有ChatGPT Plus、Pro、Business和Enterprise用戶，以及透過OpenAI API和AWS使用。",
    tags: ["OpenAI", "GPT-6 Astra", "ChatGPT", "Codex", "網路安全", "AI模型"],
    title_en: "OpenAI Releases GPT-6 Astra: Major Upgrade to ChatGPT and Codex with Top-Tier Cybersecurity and Engineering Capabilities",
    summary_en: "OpenAI officially announced the launch of its new model, GPT-6 Astra, claiming it is the \"world's smartest and most empathetic model.\" This model integrates years of research, achieving state-of-the-art levels in areas such as computer operation, browsing, software engineering, science, and professional work. GPT-6 Astra demonstrated exceptional performance in multiple professional tests, scoring 98% on FrontierMath Tier 4 and achieving 100% on ExploitBench, showcasing its powerful capabilities. In software engineering, OpenAI called it \"the best model to date,\" and specifically upgraded Codex to retain and retrieve cumulative details across multiple conversations, even when the context window is full, rather than relying solely on summaries. OpenAI described GPT-6 Astra's capabilities as having \"significantly enhanced cybersecurity abilities,\" and claimed it meets key thresholds within a \"readiness framework.\" The model is currently being rolled out to select organizations and will later be available to all ChatGPT Plus, Pro, Business, and Enterprise users, as well as through the OpenAI API and AWS.",
