    summary_en: "NVIDIA has officially announced the acquisition of AI platform Hugging Face for $12.93 billion. Through this acquisition, NVIDIA aims to strengthen Hugging Face's infrastructure and expand global developer and organizational access to artificial intelligence (AI). NVIDIA CEO Jensen Huang emphasized that Hugging Face will remain an open platform, and developers will not be forced to use NVIDIA's computing resources. Developers can continue to freely choose the required models, frameworks, cloud, and inference service providers, supporting multi-cloud and multi-accelerator development and deployment. The goal of this collaboration is to support the entire AI ecosystem, especially open-source and open-weight models, allowing all model builders to utilize the hardware and infrastructure best suited for their work.",
