    id: "20260903-10734",
    trackers: ["os"],
    category: "重點關注",
    title: "Haiku OS Beta 6 發布：搭載 WebKit 引擎與硬體加速虛擬化，提升輕量級桌面體驗",
    summary: "Haiku OS 發布了 Beta 6 版本，這是一個自 2026 年 9 月 3 日以來的重要更新。本次更新的主要亮點包括內建瀏覽器 WebPositive 採用 WebKit 渲染引擎，使其能完美處理如 Gmail 等要求較高的網頁應用。此外，透過移植 NVMM hypervisor，Haiku B6 引入了硬體加速的虛擬機功能，使用戶能夠利用 Intel 和 AMD CPU 的原生虛擬化特性運行 QEMU 虛擬機。除了瀏覽器和虛擬化提升外，本次版本還提供了完整的 Firefox 移植版（已更新至 Firefox 155）以及其他 Mozilla 家族瀏覽器選擇。Haiku OS 雖然不是 Linux 或 BSD，但它是一個獨立的、以 C++ 為主的作業系統，並具備良好的 POSIX 相容性，適合用於老舊、低階電腦的復興。開發者強調 Haiku 專注於單用戶桌面環境，而非伺服器用途。",
    tags: ["Haiku OS", "WebKit", "NVMM hypervisor", "Firefox", "BeOS", "嵌入式系統"],
    title_en: "Haiku OS Beta 6 Released: Featuring WebKit Engine and Hardware Accelerated Virtualization for Enhanced Lightweight Desktop Experience",
    summary_en: "Haiku OS has released Beta 6, a significant update since September 3, 2026. Key highlights of this update include the built-in browser, WebPositive, adopting the WebKit rendering engine, enabling it to perfectly handle demanding web applications like Gmail. Furthermore, by porting the NVMM hypervisor, Haiku B6 introduces hardware-accelerated virtual machine functionality, allowing users to run QEMU virtual machines utilizing the native virtualization features of Intel and AMD CPUs. In addition to browser and virtualization improvements, this version also provides a complete port of Firefox (updated to Firefox 155) and other Mozilla family browser choices. Although Haiku OS is neither Linux nor BSD, it is a standalone, C++-based operating system with good POSIX compatibility, making it suitable for reviving older, low-spec computers. Developers emphasize that Haiku focuses on a single-user desktop environment rather than server use.",
    tags_en: ["Haiku OS", "WebKit", "NVMM hypervisor", "Firefox", "BeOS", "Embedded Systems"],
    sources: [
      { name: "The Register", url: "https://theregister.com/os-platforms/2026/09/03/haiku-os-rises-/-beta-6-sails-open-web-/-virtual-winds-fly-fast/5294184", lang: "EN" }
    ]
