    summary_en: "To strengthen the domestic cybersecurity ecosystem, the Ministry of Science and ICT (MSIT) announced the selection of the Naver Cloud Alliance as the final implementing entity for the 'Specialized AI Foundation Model for Network Security Development' project. This project aims to integrate domestic AI and cybersecurity technological capabilities to develop an autonomous AI technology and model applicable across the domestic cybersecurity ecosystem. The selected Naver Cloud Alliance is a large industry-academia-research consortium involving 32 companies and institutions, including major IT corporations such as LG CNS and LG Uplus, cybersecurity firms like Logpresso and East Security, and institutions such as Korea Aerospace and Korea Hydro & Nuclear Power, as well as academic institutions including KAIST, Korea University, and Seoul National University. The selected alliance will begin receiving support of 256 GPU B200 units starting this month, and will conduct development over a period of 10 months. The development results will adhere to open-source principles and are planned for widespread application throughout the cybersecurity ecosystem.",
